        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&quot;data&quot;:&quot;@startuml\nskinparam rectangle {\n  BackgroundColor #F0F4FF\n  BorderColor #3A6BD4\n  FontColor #1A2235\n  FontSize 11\n  RoundCorner 12\n}\nskinparam arrow {\n  Color #3A6BD4\n  FontSize 10\n}\nskinparam defaultFontName DM Sans\n\ntitle AI-Driven Smart LMS — Technology Stack\n\n&#39; Set layout to balance horizontal/vertical spread\nleft to right direction\n\n&#39; --- LAYER 1: FRONTEND ---\nrectangle \&quot;**Presentation Layer (Frontend)**\&quot; #EEF4FF {\n  rectangle \&quot;React.js 18.x\\n(Single Page App)\&quot; as React #D6E4FF\n  rectangle \&quot;Vite 5.x\\n(Build Tool)\&quot; as Vite #D6E4FF\n  rectangle \&quot;Tailwind CSS 3.x\\n(Neumorphic UI)\&quot; as Tailwind #D6E4FF\n  \n  Vite -[hidden]down- React\n  React -[hidden]down- Tailwind\n}\n\n&#39; --- LAYER 2: BACKEND &amp; SECURITY ---\nrectangle \&quot;**Core Logic &amp; Security**\&quot; #EFFFEF {\n  rectangle \&quot;FastAPI 0.104+\\n(REST API)\&quot; as FastAPI #C8F0DC\n  rectangle \&quot;Python 3.10+\\n(Language)\&quot; as Python #C8F0DC\n  rectangle \&quot;Uvicorn\\n(ASGI Server)\&quot; as Uvicorn #C8F0DC\n  rectangle \&quot;SQLAlchemy 2.x\\n(ORM)\&quot; as SQLAlchemy #C8F0DC\n  \n  rectangle \&quot;JWT / python-jose\\n(Auth Tokens)\&quot; as JWT #FFE0D0\n  rectangle \&quot;bcrypt / passlib\\n(Password Hashing)\&quot; as Bcrypt #FFE0D0\n\n  Uvicorn -[hidden]down- Python\n  Python -[hidden]down- FastAPI\n  FastAPI -[hidden]down- SQLAlchemy\n  FastAPI -[hidden]right- JWT\n  JWT -[hidden]down- Bcrypt\n}\n\n&#39; --- LAYER 3: AI ENGINE ---\nrectangle \&quot;**AI Layer**\&quot; #F5EEFF {\n  rectangle \&quot;Dlib 19.24\\n(Face Recognition)\&quot; as Dlib #EDE0FF\n  rectangle \&quot;Gemini API\\n(gemini-2.0-flash)\&quot; as Gemini #EDE0FF\n  rectangle \&quot;FAISS 1.7+\\n(Vector Search)\&quot; as FAISS #EDE0FF\n  rectangle \&quot;Sentence-Transformers\\n(Text Embeddings)\&quot; as ST #EDE0FF\n  rectangle \&quot;difflib + ST\\n(Plagiarism)\&quot; as Plag #EDE0FF\n  \n  Dlib -[hidden]down- Gemini\n  Gemini -[hidden]down- FAISS\n  FAISS -[hidden]down- ST\n  ST -[hidden]down- Plag\n}\n\n&#39; --- LAYER 4: DATABASE ---\nrectangle \&quot;**Data Layer**\&quot; #FFFDE7 {\n  rectangle \&quot;MySQL 8.x\\n(Relational Database)\&quot; as MySQL #FFF9C4\n}\n\n&#39; ── Flow Arrows ───────────────────────────────────\nReact      -right-&gt; FastAPI   : HTTP / REST\nFastAPI    -right-&gt; Gemini    : AI Request\nFastAPI    -right-&gt; Dlib      : Recognition\nFastAPI    -right-&gt; FAISS     : RAG Search\nFastAPI    -down-&gt; SQLAlchemy : ORM\nSQLAlchemy -down-&gt; MySQL      : SQL\n\n@enduml&quot;,&quot;format&quot;:&quot;svg&quot;}" id="14pVjtuajESJFR7WagT--21">
